#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/_shared.html:136
msgid "Check website status on"
msgstr "Verificar status do site em"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/_shared.html:142
msgid ""
"Google's Safe Browsing technology examines billions of URLs per day looking "
"for unsafe websites, many of which are legitimate websites that have been "
"compromised. When an unsafe site is detected, warning is shown on Google "
"Search and in web browsers. Here you can see whether this website is "
"currently marked by Google as dangerous to visit."
msgstr ""
"A tecnologia Safe Browsing do Google examina bilhões de URLs por dia em "
"busca de sites inseguros, muitos dos quais são sites legítimos que foram "
"comprometidos. Quando um site inseguro é detectado, um aviso é exibido no "
